Z||000000||gargoyle||12-16-2001||06:14 PM||||Well I think this may be a new source but I thought I post it anyway. They are very good about replying to questions. The site is <A HREF="http://www.performwheels.com.au." TARGET=_blank>www.performwheels.com.au.</A>  I was looking for something like the Minilites and found these guys. They make one called Superlite but not<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"> for the Fiero. Here is what they can make in a 16x7" for us along with the offset: Tempest 38&45, Lotus 38&45, BB6 38, Comet 35, FX5 40, & Hunter 38&45. They are $205/wheel and freight would be $270-320. I kind of like the <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/cool.gif"> BB6 & FX5  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/cool.gif">. What does everybody else think. I'm just looking for something different. Oh, they shut down for the holidays so they wouldn't be able to produce any of these until mid to late January||||reg||1
